      <div class="hero__overlay">
        <p class="eyebrow">Peptide Therapy in Denver</p>
        <h1>Neuro-Recovery in Greenwood Village / Denver</h1>
        <p class="hero__summary">A clinician-guided multi-component protocol for brain fog, cognitive recovery, and neuro-inflammatory support: built for adults in Greenwood Village and Denver who want medical oversight, not internet guesswork.</p>
